$DATUM The asymmetric Heck cyclization of dienyl aryl triflate 21 was initially
examined using Pd(OAc)2/BINAP as the precatalyst (Scheme 3). Under these
conditions, intramolecular Heck reaction of 21 proceeded readily at 80 °C
in acetonitrile (or toluene) in the presence of
1,2,2,6,6-pentamethylpiperidine (PMP) to give dihydrocarbazole 23 (ca.
60% yield).17
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM stereoselective, Heck cyclization, geometry of BINAP is not defined
