$DATUM (E)-N-tert-Butyl-5-(tert-butyldimethylsilyloxy)-5-methyl-4-methylenehex-2-enamide
(entry 8). Lithium chloride (169.6 mg, 4.00 mmol), X-Phos (9.6 mg, 0.02
mmol), 3-(tert-butyldimethylsilyloxy)-3-methylbut-1-en- 2-yl diphenyl
phosphate (264.5 mg, 0.60 mmol), N-tert-butyl acrylamide (50.9 mg, 0.40
mmol), Cy2NMe (170 μL, 0.80 mmol), PdCl2(COD) (5.7 mg, 0.02 mmol)
dissolved in a 1:1 DMF-Dioxane mixture (3 mL) were reacted for 24 h at
100°C. The crude product was purified by flash chromatography on silica
gel using CH2Cl2 as eluent. This afforded 72.3 mg of the title compound
(57 % yield) as a colorless solid. 1H NMR (400 MHz, C6D6) δ (ppm) 7.60
(d, 1H, J = 15.2 Hz), 6.15 (d, 1H, J = 15.2 Hz), 5.71 (bs, 1H, NH), 5.29
(d, 1H, J = 0.4 Hz), 5.25 (d, 1H, J = 1.2 Hz), 1.34 (s, 9H), 1.31 (s,
6H), 0.99 (s, 9H), 0.09 (s, 6H). 13C NMR (100 MHz, C6D6) δ (ppm) 165.0,
153.5, 139.0, 125.0, 111.0, 75.3, 51.0, 30.2, 29.0, 26.3, 18.6, -1.9.
HRMS C18H35NO2Si [M+Na+]: 348.2335 found: 348.2346.
