$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: General procedure. The synthesis of 18 is
given as reference. In a 35 mL pressure tube, triethoxyvinylsilane (0.77
mL, 3.5 mmol) was added to an aqueous sodium hydroxide 0.50 M solution
(10.7 mL, 5.35 mmol) containing a 20% (w/w) of PEG 2000 (2.14 g). The
mixture was vigorously stirred for 5 min at room temperature and
3-bromopyridine (0.178 mL, 1.78 mmol) and palladium(II) acetate (0.4 mg,
1.8 μmol) were subsequently added. The reaction mixture was vigorously
stirred for 3 h at 140 °C. Then, 1-(4-bromophenyl)ethanone (0.3615 g,
1.80 mmol) and palladium(II) acetate (0.4 mg, 1.8 μmol) were added and
the reaction mixture was again stirred for 6 h at 140 °C. When the
reaction time elapsed, the mixture was worked up as described above.
3-((1E,3E)-4-Phenylbuta-1,3-dienyl)pyridine (24).8 Following the general
procedure, triethoxyvinylsilane (0.77 mL, 3.5 mmol), an aqueous sodium
hydroxide solution 0.50 M (14.0 mL, 7.0 mmol), PEG 2000 (2.8 g) and (A)
3-bromopyridine (0.178 mL, 1.78 mmol) and palladium(II) acetate (0.4 mg,
1.8 μmol) were warmed for 3 h at 140 °C. Subsequently (B), β-bromostyrene
(0.284 mL, 2.14 mmol) and palladium(II) acetate (1.6 mg, 7.1 μmol) were
added and the mixture and the reaction was continued for other 15 h at
100 °C. The final product was extracted with ethyl acetate and purified
by flash chromatography with hexane/ethyl acetate 1:2 on silica gel. The
product as a pale yellow solid (0.1952 g, 53%). (R f = 0.27). M.p.:
100-102 °C. 1H NMR (CDCl3, 300 MHz): δ 6.57-6.75 (m, 2 H, H5 H),
6.90-7.04 (m, 2 H; H6), 7.43 (d, 3 J 12,13= 7.2, 2 H; H12), 7.33 (t, 3 J
13,12 ≈ 3 J 13,14= 7.2, 2 H; H13), 7.23 (m, 1 H; H14), 7.46 (dt, 3 J 4,5=
7.9, 4 J 4,6≈ 4 J 4,2= 2.0, 1 H; H4), 8.44 (dd, 3 J 6,5= 4.9, 4 J 6,4=
1.3, 1 H; H6), 8.63 (d, 4 J 2,4= 2.0, 1 H; H2). 13C{1H} NMR (CDCl3, 75
MHz): δ 123.51 (C5), 126.52 (C12), 127.94, 128.59, 128.71 (C13), 128.73,
131.19, 132.42 (C4), 133.00 (C3), 134.20, 136.94 (C11), 148.39, 148.42
(C2, C6). EI-MS (70eV): m/z (%) 207 (100) [M+], 192 (17), 178 (10), 129
(20), 115 (35). IR (KBr): ν 3030 m, 3013 m, 1871 w, 1619 w, 1573 m, 1563
m, 1492 m, 1473 m, 1448 m, 1413 m, 1337 w, 1291 m, 1207 m, 1184 m, 1160
w, 1123 m, 1100 m, 1074 m, 1044 m, 1021 s, 987 s, 916 m, 836 m, 799 m,
749 s, 708 s, 692 s, 621 w, 610 w.
