$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Synthesis of
{4-[1-(R)-Methyl-2-(1-methyl-pyrrolidin-2-(S)-ylmethoxy)-cyclopent-2-
enyl]-phenyl}-phenyl-methanone (7g). The reactants were added to the
reaction vial in the following order: 4-iodobenzophenone 2h (0.60 mmol,
0.185 g), enol ether 6a (0.78 mmol, 0.152 g), Pd(OAc)2 (0.018 mmol, 0.004
g), NaOAc (0.72 mmol, 0.059 g), LiCl (1.20 mmol, 0.051 g), K2CO3 (0.72
mmol, 0.100 g), DMF (2 mL) and water (0.2 mL). The vial was closed and
the contents were magnetically stirred and heated for 24 h. After
cooling, the reaction mixture was diluted with diethyl ether and was
washed five times with NaOH (0.1 M). The combined aqueous phases were
additionally extracted twice with diethyl ether. The ethereal phases were
combined and dried with K2CO3 (s). Evaporation of the solvent and silica
column chromatography (hexane/diethyl ether/triethylamine, 1:1:0.05)
yielded 0.119 g pure product 7g (53%). 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3) δ
7.81-7.72 (m, 4H), 7.58-7.38 (m, 5H), 4.66-4.64 (m, 1H), 3.87-3.81 (m,
1H), 3.69-3.62 (m, 1H), 3.06-2.99 (m, 1H), 2.58-2.50 (m, 1H), 2.38 (s,
3H), 2.31-2.19 (m, 3H), 2.17-1.99 (m, 2H), 1.95-1.84 (m, 1H), 1.81-1.64
(m, 2H), 1.57-1.44 (m, 4H); 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ 196.6, 163.0,
153.2, 138.0, 135.1, 132.2, 130.2, 130.1, 128.3, 126.2, 95.1, 73.1, 64.0,
57.8, 51.2, 41.7, 41.0, 29.0, 26.0, 25.2, 22.9; MS (70 eV) m/z (relative
intensity) 375 (M+, 0.5), 84 (100), 42 (4). Anal calcd for C25H29NO2: C,
79.96; H, 7.78. Found: C, 79.84; H, 7.67.
