$DATUM (E)-2-(tert-Butoxycarbonylamino)ethyl
4-(3-methyl-2-oxotetrahydrofuran-3-yl)penta- 2,4-dienoate (entry 6).
Lithium chloride (169.6 mg, 4.00 mmol), X-Phos (9.6 mg, 0.02 mmol),
1-(3-methyl-2-oxotetrahydrofuran-3-yl)vinyl diphenyl phosphate (225.0 mg,
0.60 mmol), 2-(tert-butoxycarbonylamino) ethyl acrylate (86.1 mg, 0.40
mmol), Cy2NMe (170 μL, 0.80 mmol), PdCl2(COD) (5.7 mg, 0.02 mmol)
dissolved in a 1:1 DMF-Dioxane mixture (3 mL) were reacted for 24 h at
100°C. The crude product was purified by flash chromatography on silica
gel using EtOAc:Pentane (1:10) as eluent. This afforded 66.2 mg of the
title compound (49% yield) as a colorless solid. 1H NMR (400 MHz, CD3CN)
5.42 (s, 1H), 4.34 (ddd, 1H, J = 8.8, 7.6, 5.6 Hz), 4.25 (dt, 1H, J =
8.8, 7.2 Hz), 4.16 (t, 2H, J = 5.6 Hz), 3.33 (q, 2H, J = 5.6 Hz), 2.54
(ddd, 1H, 13.2, 7.2, 6.0 Hz), 2.23-2.16 (m, 1H), 1.44 (s, 3H), 1.42 (s,
9H). 13C NMR (100 MHz, CD3CN) δ (ppm) 180.2, 166.9, 156.9, 145.3, 143.8,
121.6, 120.6, 79.4, 66.3, 64.5, 47.9, 40.2, 35.9, 28.8, 22.7. HRMS
C17H25O6N [M++Na]: calculate: 362.1580 found: 362.1578.
