$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 2-Bromo-2,-vinyl-4,5'-bis(3,5-di-tert-butyl-4-7 acetoxyphenyl)stilbene.
2-Bromo-2'-methyl-4,5'-bis(3,5-di-tert-butyl-4-acetoxyphenyl)stilbene was
prepared by coupling
2-bromo-4-(3,5-di-tert-butyl-4-acetoxyphenyl)styrene8 with
2-iodo-4-(3,5-di-tert-butyl-4-acetoxyphenyl)toluene via the Heck
reaction. Palladium acetate (235 mg, 1.05 mmol), tri-o-tolylphosphine
(636 mg, 2.09 mmol), and triethylamine (5.29 g, 52.3 mmol) were added to
a DMF (26.1 mL) solution of
2-bromo-4-(3,5-di-tert-butyl-4-acetoxyphenyl)styrene (2.24 g, 5.22 mmol)
and 2-iodo-4-(3,5-di-tert-butyl-4-acetoxyphenyl)toluene (2.43 g, 5.23
mmol), and stirred for 18 h at 45 °C. Yield 48 %. 1H-NMR (CDCl3, 500 MHz,
ppm): δ 1.40 (s, 36H, tert-butyl), 2.38 (s, 6H, -O-CO-CH3), 2.48 (s, 3H,
CH3), 7.25-7.81 (m, 12H, Ar, -HC=CH-); 13C-NMR(CDCl3, ppm); 6 19.65,
22.69, 31.45, 35.61, 124.52, 125.01, 126.52, 126.98, 128.95, 129.24,
130.83, 131.62, 134.88, 136.00, 136.41, 136.45, 138.19, 139.90, 142.37,
142.68, 143.03, 147.49, 148.06, 171.08, 171.07; IR (KBr pellet, cm-1 1763
(ν C=O), 964 (δ transHC=CH); FAB-MS (m/z) 765, 767 (found), calcd for M =
765.9.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM stereoselective, Heck reaction
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM A Nanometer-Sized High-Spin Polyradical:
Poly(4-phenoxyl-1,2-phenylenevinylene) Planarily Extended in a Non-Kekule
Fashion and Its Magnetic Force Microscopic Images
