$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM rac-1-(cis-6,8-Dimethyl-1H-carbazol-9(2H,4aH,9aH)-yl)ethanone (24b Δ3,4):
In a sealable pressure tube were placed a stir bar, anti-27c (0.107 g,
0.250 mmol), Pd2(dba)3.CHCl3 (0.013 g, 0.0125 mmol), and P(o-tol)3 (0.017
g, 0.055 mmol). A degassed 10:1 MeCN:H2O solvent mixture (2.5 mL) was
added, followed by Me2NBu (0.051 g, 0.500 mmol). The tube was sealed,
heated at 80 °C for 4 h, and recooled to room temperature. Saturated
aqueous NH4Cl (5 mL) was added, and the mixture was extracted with EtOAc
(3 x 5 mL). The combined organic layers were dried over MgSO4, filtered,
and concentrated by rotary evaporation. Gradient column chromatography
(7:1 pentane:Et2O to 1:2 pentane:Et2O) provided the title compound (0.044
g, 73%) as a white solid. mp 136-137 °C: 1H NMR (300 MHz, CDCl3) δ 6.85
(s, 1H), 6.82 (s, 1H), 6.06 (m with clear d, J = 9.9 Hz, 1H), 5.94-5.85
(m, 1H), 4.50 (br s, 1H), 3.90 (br s, 1H), 2.30 (s, 3H), 2.27 (s, 3H),
2.23 (s, 3H), 2.17-2.04 (m, 2H), 2.03-1.90 (m, 1H), 1.58-1.38 (br m, 1H);
13C NMR (75 MHz, CDCl3) δ 168.2 (br), 138.1, 137.5 (br), 137.3, 135.0,
130.2, 128.1, 124.5, 121.5, 61.9, 41.2, 24.5, 23.0, 22.9, 20.9, 20.3;
FTIR (thin film, CHCl3, cm-1) 3025, 2924, 2840, 1666, 1412, 1385, 1350,
853, 783; LRMS (EI) m/z 241 (M+, 100), 199 (98), 184 (50), 158 (52); HRMS
(EI) calcd for C16H19NO [M]+: 241.1467, found: 241.1461.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
