$DATUM (E)-2-(tert-Butoxycarbonylamino)ethyl 4-cyclohexylpenta-2,4-dienoate
(entry 9). Lithium chloride (169.6 mg, 4.00 mmol), X-Phos (9.6 mg, 0.02
mmol), 1-cyclohexylvinyl diphenyl phosphate (215.0 mg, 0.60 mmol),
2-(tert-butoxycarbonylamino)ethyl acrylate (86.1 mg, 0.40 mmol), Cy2NMe
(170 μL, 0.80 mmol), PdCl2(COD) (5.7 mg, 0.02 mmol) dissolved in a 1:1
DMF-Dioxane mixture (3 mL) were reacted for 24 h at 100°C. The crude
product was purified by flash chromatography on silica gel using
EtOAc:Pentane (1:10) as eluent. This afforded 60.7 mg of the title
compound (47% yield) as a colorless solid. 1H NMR (400 MHz, CD3CN) δ
(ppm) 7.28 (d, 1H, J = 16.0 Hz), 5.99 (d, 1H, J = 16.0 Hz), 5.45 (bs, 1H,
NH), 5.41 (s, 1H), 5.35 (s, 1H), 4.13 (t, 2H, J = 5.4 Hz), 2.30 (q, 2H, J
= 5.4 Hz), 2.30-2.23 (m, 1H), 1.82-1.73 (m, 5H), 1.44-1.33 (m, 2H), 1.42
(s, 9H), 1.27-1.15 (m, 3H). 13C NMR (100 MHz, CD3CN) δ (ppm) 167.6,
151.6, 147.6, 121.4, 118.2, 79.4, 64.2, 40.3, 40.0, 33.6, 28.6, 27.4,
27.0. HRMS C18H29O4N [M++Na]: calculate: 346.1994 found: 346.1992.
